WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.632
(upbeat music)

00:00:01.632 --> 00:00:04.170
- All right let's finish
up this hour of spookiness

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:06.330
with one last story to give
you goosebumps, hopefully.

00:00:06.330 --> 00:00:07.616
This is What I'm Liking.

00:00:07.616 --> 00:00:10.920
(upbeat music)

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:13.860
Many people go all out with
their Halloween decorations,

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:16.680
but one family seems to have
everyone pretty much beat

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:19.230
with their "Stranger
Things" inspired decor.

00:00:19.230 --> 00:00:21.510
Their front yard has been
completely transformed

00:00:21.510 --> 00:00:23.280
into the Upside Down world

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:25.590
with many of its creepiest creatures.

00:00:25.590 --> 00:00:28.440
But the true highlight is this.

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:30.840
It's the spitting image
of the character Max

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:33.930
being mysteriously levitated
10 feet in the air.

00:00:33.930 --> 00:00:34.763
It's awesome.

00:00:34.763 --> 00:00:37.470
And it looks pretty close to
the actual scene in the show,

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:38.550
so that's pretty cool.

00:00:38.550 --> 00:00:39.690
So let's meet the family

00:00:39.690 --> 00:00:41.910
behind this special effects masterpiece.

00:00:41.910 --> 00:00:43.800
Everybody say hi to Dave and Aubrey

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:45.450
and their kids Brooke and Gage

00:00:45.450 --> 00:00:47.767
celebrating Halloween as their favorite

00:00:47.767 --> 00:00:49.502
"Stranger Things" characters.

00:00:49.502 --> 00:00:51.600
(audience cheering and clapping)

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:54.390
All right, so Dave, happy Halloween.

00:00:54.390 --> 00:00:56.790
That looks like it's really levitating.

00:00:56.790 --> 00:00:58.650
So how did you pull that off?

00:00:58.650 --> 00:00:59.520
- Well, that's a secret

00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:01.350
I think we're gonna keep
just a little bit longer

00:01:01.350 --> 00:01:02.820
until Halloween's over.

00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:04.740
It's something we did for the community

00:01:04.740 --> 00:01:07.830
so we really wanna kind
of keep it under wraps.

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:10.710
Once our video on TikTok went viral

00:01:10.710 --> 00:01:12.720
I think it's at like 14 million views now.

00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:15.060
Keeping it a secret was the hardest part

00:01:15.060 --> 00:01:17.310
and really we pretty much
have just been telling people

00:01:17.310 --> 00:01:19.950
that she's made of pool
noodles and grocery bags

00:01:19.950 --> 00:01:22.500
as well as most of our
"Stranger Things" set up.

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:24.660
Pretty much all done in pool noodles.

00:01:24.660 --> 00:01:27.540
The support has been unbelievable.

00:01:27.540 --> 00:01:28.530
- It's so cool.

00:01:28.530 --> 00:01:31.800
So how long did it take
to put this all together?

00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:34.350
- So it's really been a full-time job.

00:01:34.350 --> 00:01:39.350
It took us about two months to
get up and build everything.

00:01:40.020 --> 00:01:43.470
But the best part is we're
able to do this as a family

00:01:43.470 --> 00:01:46.080
and we love Max as a character

00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:48.930
and we're just happy to
see everyone else loves her

00:01:48.930 --> 00:01:51.300
just as much as we do.

00:01:51.300 --> 00:01:53.070
How did you help Gage?

00:01:53.070 --> 00:01:56.080
- I helped glue things together

00:01:57.270 --> 00:01:58.103
and...

00:01:59.310 --> 00:02:04.020
I was very happy we could do this.

00:02:04.020 --> 00:02:05.220
- What about you, Brooke?

00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:07.327
- I helped us sample and paint things

00:02:07.327 --> 00:02:08.640
including the vines

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:12.330
and it's just crazy that
we're basically global

00:02:12.330 --> 00:02:13.680
in the entire world.

00:02:13.680 --> 00:02:16.050
- I love y'all so much. What a fun family.

00:02:16.050 --> 00:02:17.700
Thank you so much for sharing this with us

00:02:17.700 --> 00:02:18.900
and also with your whole neighborhood.

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:19.733
That's so cool.

00:02:19.733 --> 00:02:22.061
I'm liking your post right now.

00:02:22.061 --> 00:02:23.957
(audience cheering)

00:02:23.957 --> 00:02:25.590
- And that's not all.

00:02:25.590 --> 00:02:28.230
Our season long partner,
Pilot Pen makers of FriXion

00:02:28.230 --> 00:02:30.150
the ghost erasable pen of
the "Kelly Clarkson Show"

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:33.510
want to celebrate those creating
fearlessly just like y'all.

00:02:33.510 --> 00:02:35.280
So they're giving you $1,000.

00:02:35.280 --> 00:02:37.424
You can put that towards
your next Halloween.

00:02:37.424 --> 00:02:39.602
(audience cheering)

00:02:39.602 --> 00:02:40.435
- Oh my god.

00:02:40.435 --> 00:02:41.497
- How's that for global?

00:02:41.497 --> 00:02:42.899
(imitating air horn)

00:02:42.899 --> 00:02:43.802
(chuckling)

00:02:43.802 --> 00:02:44.635
- Thank you.

00:02:44.635 --> 00:02:46.070
- No, thank y'all so much.

00:02:46.070 --> 00:02:47.400
We love y'all, we appreciate it.

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:48.600
Thank you to all our guests today,

00:02:48.600 --> 00:02:50.246
Rose McIver, Loni Love

00:02:50.246 --> 00:02:52.112
(crowd cheering)

00:02:52.112 --> 00:02:54.724
- Brittany Briar, and Creepy Chloe.

00:02:54.724 --> 00:02:57.360
And a huge shout out to
everyone in the department,

00:02:57.360 --> 00:03:00.044
art department, lighting,
production, producers.

00:03:00.044 --> 00:03:02.482
Everybody involved did such a great job.

00:03:02.482 --> 00:03:04.106
My band, everybody killed it.

00:03:04.106 --> 00:03:05.892
We couldn't have pulled
off this incredible hour

00:03:05.892 --> 00:03:08.532
without each and every one of
you on this staff thank you.

00:03:08.532 --> 00:03:10.159
Y'all have a great Halloween

00:03:10.159 --> 00:03:11.865
and if it's not try and change it.

00:03:11.865 --> 00:03:13.283
We'll see you back here tomorrow.

